      <activity id="a14e3ebb-9ccf-5dc0-a657-18a0ca6cbe0a" activityNameId="256c0fad-a7f2-58c7-82dc-740d59a23d84" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="2" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Flax insulation, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Flax insulation, at regional storage
na;
UUID: 1dde3a89-6123-3c70-aebd-25d06f726f26
Market dataset representing the supply of flax insulation in Switzerland. The market share of ARBIO was estimated to 90% by Gaëlle Talandier. The remaining 10% are produced in France and charged with a 10% addition for non-declaration of information. Transport efforts for the imported share are calculated according to the procedure described in the QualiBOB report part A.; Geography: Switzerland
Location:  Switzerland
Technology: Modern technology
Time period: 2010 and after
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data were compiled from dedicated company. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1dde3a89-6123-3c70-aebd-25d06f726f26.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
